{
  "venvPath": ".",
  "venv": ".venv",
  "extraPaths": ["python"],
  "include": ["tools", "python/hokku", "python/tests"],
  "comment": "tools/ is Windows-oriented (SD-imaging, ctypes.windll, vendor GUIs); analyze it as Windows so it type-checks the same on the Linux CI runner as on a dev machine. python/ (the server) keeps the host default. Tools importing packages that can't install on Linux (pywinauto, playwright, capstone, pyelftools) are excluded below.",
